Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So, as we begin the school year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.16,0:00:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, for many parents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it's also a time where there are a lot of expenses for school
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.92,0:00:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and we want our kids to have the best start in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have things like schoolbooks, textbooks, uniforms
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and other expenses that parents have to fork out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And during these times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you have cost of living concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.16,0:00:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,challenging times
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.48,0:00:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,we want to help parents from low-income families
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to support their kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,MENDAKI is introducing the Ready for School e-voucher initiative
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.20,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,which we hope to help kids
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.46,0:00:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,from Primary One all the way up to university.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This year, MENDAKI is giving out $250 e-vouchers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.38,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,that parents can use for their children
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it's schoolbooks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,whether it is stationery or even shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.50,0:00:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's important because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,especially for parents who have more than one child
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.78,0:00:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,as you know, sometimes you have two or three kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.48,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's always challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,to try to fork out that much expense at one go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.80,0:00:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pegging it at about $1,000
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.74,0:00:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,per capita income and below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So we expect more than 22,000 students
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:00:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,who could benefit from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And this is in addition to about 13,000 others
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.58,0:01:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,that typically benefit from our TTFS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.40,0:01:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,and other MENDAKI schemes as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's an application basis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and we start to take applications from 1st December.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So we hope that this will do its part
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,to help parents and children have a good start for the year
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.20,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and not to worry about some of these expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that would have otherwise held them back.
